The texts are the official constitutional text of the Republic of Benin, published openly by the Assemblée nationale du Bénin (assemblee-nationale.bj) and the Cour constitutionnelle du Bénin (courconstitutionnelle.bj). A constitution and other official legislative texts are public acts of the State; neither site states a reuse restriction on them. Credit the publishers as the source of the texts.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
